<title>UK: SOCCER-RAITH STAGE PRIZE-WINNING TRIUMPH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RAITH STAGE PRIZE-WINNING TRIUMPH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A gambler won 293,000 pounds ($475,000) for a 10 pounds ($17) accumulator bet on Monday when Raith beat Airdrieonians 4-1 in the Scottish Cup third round.</p>
<p>The unknown punter forecast the winners of 12 matches in England and Scotland on Saturday -- then had to wait 48 hours for Raith to clinch his jackpot with triumph number 13.</p>
